# logs parser --------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# The slice's broken parser. origin/main's GetLogs on a real$
# line (menu/logs_parser.golden; file_logs_repository.go:51-57;$
# nothing calls it but its wrappers and tests), and the stand-$
# in's fix. The screen needs a level only to colour WARNING and$
# ERROR.$
$
# The line -----------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  2026/10/20 12:00:05 ERROR: Failed to configure firewall:$
      exit status 1$
$
# GetLogs, origin/main -----------------------------------------$
$
   -  Time                 2026/10/20$
   -  Level                12:00:05$
   -  Message              ERROR: Failed to configure firewal...$
$
# parseLogLine, the stand-in -----------------------------------$
$
   -  Time                 2026/10/20 12:00:05$
   -  Level                ERROR$
   -  Message              Failed to configure firewall: exit...$
$
$

